<title>USA: ITT opens first institute in Nevada.</title>
<headline>ITT opens first institute in Nevada.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ITT Educational Services Inc said Tuesday classes have started at its ITT Technical Institute in Henderson, Nevada, its first in the state.</p>
<p>The Nevada institute brings the total number of ITT Technical Institutes to 60 in 27 states.</p>
<p>ITT, a private college system, provides technology-oriented study programs.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
